---
description: AdvisorPPC account changes in Cursor are not all previews
alwaysApply: true
---

AdvisorPPC read tools return data and change nothing.
`advisor_write` returns a preview and applies a change only after the user confirms that preview.
Some directly listed change tools apply on the first call and have no confirm argument. That includes `ga_pause_campaign_tool`, `ga_enable_campaign_tool`, `ga_pause_ad_group_tool`, `ga_enable_ad_group_tool`, `ga_pause_ad_tool`, `ga_enable_ad_tool`, `ga_pause_keyword_tool` and `ga_enable_keyword_tool`.
`disconnect_platform_tool`, `switch_account_tool` and `update_settings_tool` return a preview when confirm is false and apply only when confirm is true.
Cursor asks before a tool call by default. In Auto-review, an allowlisted tool runs immediately, and every other tool is routed through the classifier.
Do not say that every change waits for approval.
Do not say that every other change tool applies at once.
